# Documentation Reorganization Plan: gurudevi-mobile (Priority: Docs v 3.0)

This plan prioritizes the user's "Core Docs" in `Docs v 3.0` while strategically integrating the best parts of the newer AI-generated root docs (like "Thuthimal").

## 1. Core Consolidation (Alpha Foundation)
We will unify the vision and architecture in `Docs v 3.0/Core/`.

- **[NEW] GURUDEVI_ARCHITECTURE_v5_0.md**: The definitive technical truth. Merges the rigorous foundation of `v2.0` (ADRs, Sync, Multi-tenancy) with the roadmap and interface definitions from `v4.0`.
- **[MODIFY] NORTH_STAR.md**: Re-anchor the project to the "Lotus Philosophy" and "Thuthimal" (Gratitude Economy), explicitly rejecting exploitative gamification. **Sanctuary is the aesthetic, not the product category.**
- **[NEW] ALPHA_RELEASE_TRACKER.md**: Consolidate [ACTION_ITEMS.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/ACTION_ITEMS.md), [BUILD_ORDER.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/Core/BUILD_ORDER.md), and [CURRENT_SPRINT.md](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/Docs%20v%203.0/Core/CURRENT_SPRINT.md) into one actionable source of truth for the Alpha launch.

